{
  "description": "validation with pinned synthetic fixtures: asserted successes and malformed evidence are refused, the fixture is pinned by hash and must name the exact capability and environment, a bad input degrades and a good one validates (synthetic only, not runtime), known evidence replays without a revision, an old success cannot erase a newer failure, and a changed fixture or inventory file is refused.",
